{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": "διά, poet. διαί ( ζά, q.v.), Prep. governing gen. and acc.— Rad. sense, through; never anastroph. [Prop. δι^α^: but"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hom.", "author_abbreviation": "Hom.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "uses ι— at the beginning of a line,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 3.357", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "4.135", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", al.: also α—, metri gr., freq. in"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hom.", "author_abbreviation": "Hom.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", for which"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A.", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "uses διαί in lyr.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ag. 448", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", al.] WITH GEN. of Place or Space: of motion in a line, from one end to the other, right through, in"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hom.", "author_abbreviation": "Hom.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "freq. of the effect of weapons,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "διὰ μὲν ἀσπίδος ἦλθε . . ἔγχος καὶ διὰ θώρηκος . . Il. 3.357", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δουρὶ βάλεν Δάμασον κυνέης διά 12.183", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ὤμου . . ἔγχος ἦλθεν 4.481", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; in Prose,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τιτρώσκειν διὰ τοῦ θώρακος X. An. 1.8.26", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; διὰ τοῦ ὀρόφου ἐφαίνετο πῦρ ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "7.4.16", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": also of persons, διὰ Σκαιῶν πεδίονδ' ἔχον ὠκέας ἵππους out through the Scaean gate,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 3.263", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; δι' ἠέρος αἰθέρ' ἵκανεν quite through the lower air even to the ether,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 14.288", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "2.458", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; διὰ Τρώων πέτετο straight through them,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "13.755", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ὄμματος . . λείβων δάκρυον S. OC 1250", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.: also in Compos. with πρό and ἐκ, v. διαπρό, διέκ : in adverbial phrases, διὰ πασῶν (sc. χορδῶν), v. διαπασῶν :"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "διὰ πάσης throughout, Th. 1.14", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "διὰ κενῆς idly, Id. 4.126", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. (cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "111.1", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ".c). of motion through a space, but not in a line, throughout, ouer,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἑπόμεσθα διὰ πεδίοιο Il. 11.754", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ὄρεσφι 10.185", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", al.; ὀδύνη διὰ χροὸς ἦλθε through all his frame,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "11.398", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τεῦχε βοὴν διὰ ἄστεος Od. 10.118", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ὁμίλου Il. 6.226", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.;"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "θορύβου διὰ τῶν τάξεων ἰόντος X. An. 1.8.16", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "2.4.26", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; later, in quoting an authority,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἱστορεῖ δ. τῆς δευτέρας in the course of . ., Ath. 10.438b", "author_abbreviation": "Ath.", "tlg_author": "0008", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". in the midst of,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 9.468", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "κεῖτο τανυσσάμενος δ. μήλων Od. 9.298", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; between,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δ. τῶν πλευρέων ταμόντα Hp. Morb. 2.61", "author_abbreviation": "Hp.", "tlg_author": "0627", "tlg_work": "023", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": hence, of pre-eminence,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἔπρεπε καὶ δ. πάντων Il. 12.104", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τετίμακε δι' ἀνθρώπων Pi. I. 4(3).37", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εὐδοκιμέοντι δ. πάντων Hdt. 6.63", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.25", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. in Prose, sts. of extension, along,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "παρήκει δ. τῆσδε τῆς θαλάσσης ἡ ἀκτή Id. 4.39", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(but πέταται δ. θαλάσσας across the sea,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. N. 6.48", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ");"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "λόφος, δι' οὗ τὸ σταύρωμα περιεβέβληντο X. HG 7.4.22", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". in Prose, of Intervals of Space, δ. τριήκοντα δόμων at intervals of thirty layers, i. e. after every thirtieth layer,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 1.179", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; δ. δέκα ἐπάλξεων at every tenth battlement,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 3.21", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; cf. infr."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "11.3", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": of a single interval, δ. πέντε σταδίων at a distance of five stades,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 7.30", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "198", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; δ. τοσούτου μᾶλλον ἢ δ. πολλῶν ἡμερῶν ὁδοῦ at so short a distance, etc.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 2.29", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; δ. πολλοῦ at a great distance apart,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. 3.94", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δ. πλείστου Id. 2.97", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ἐλάσσονος Id. 3.51", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὕδατα δ. μακροῦ ἀλόμενα Hp.", "author_abbreviation": "Hp.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Aër."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "9", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. of Time, of duration from one end of a period to the other, throughout, δ. παντὸς [τοῦ χρόνου]"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 9.13", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ὅλου τοῦ αἰῶνος Th. 1.70", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' αἰῶνος S. El. 1024", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ἡμέρας ὅλης Ar. Pax 27", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ὅλης τῆς νυκτός X. An. 4.2.4", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.: without an Adj., δι' ἡμέρης all day long,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 1.97", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δ. νυκτός Th. 2.4", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. An. 4.6.22", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(but δ. νυκτός in the course of the night, by night,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Act.Ap. 5.19", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0031", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "PRyl. 138.15", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(i A. D.), etc.);"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δ. νυκτὸς καὶ ἡμέρας Pl. R. 343b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; δι' ἐνιαυτοῦ, δι' ἔτους,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Fr. 569.8", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "012", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "V. 1058", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δ. βίου Pl. Smp. 183e", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.;"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δ. τέλους from beginning to end, A. Pr. 275", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. R. 519c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.: with Adjs. alone,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δ. παντός continually, A. Ch. 862", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(lyr.), etc.; δι' ὀλίγου for a short time,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 1.77", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δ. μακροῦ E. Hec. 320", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὁ δ. μέσου χρόνος Hdt. 8.27", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". of the interval which has passed between two points of Time, δ. χρόνου πολλοῦ or δ. πολλοῦ χρ. after a long time,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. 3.27", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Pl. 1045", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δ. μακρῶν χρόνων Pl. Ti. 22d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "031", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": without an Adj., δ. χρόνου after a time,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Ph. 758", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Cyr. 1.4.28", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; δι' ἡμερῶν after several days,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ev.Marc. 2.1", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0031", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; and with Adjs. alone,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ὀλίγου Th. 5.14", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐ δ. μακροῦ Id. 6.15", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "91", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δ. πολλοῦ Luc. Nigr. 2", "author_abbreviation": "Luc.", "tlg_author": "0062", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.: with Numerals,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ἐτέων εἴκοσι Hdt. 6.118", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "OGI 56.38", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(iii B. C.), etc.: but δ. τῆς ἑβδόμης till the seventh day,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Luc. Hist.Conscr. 21", "author_abbreviation": "Luc.", "tlg_author": "0062", "tlg_work": "053", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": also distributively, χρόνος δ. χρόνου προὔβαινε time after time,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Ph. 285", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄλλος δι' ἄλλου E. Andr. 1248", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". of successive Intervals, δ. τρίτης ἡμέρης every other day,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 2.37", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; δ. τρίτου ἔτεος ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "4", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; δ. πεντετηρίδος every four years (with inclusive reckoning),"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. 3.97", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; δι' ἔτους πέμπτου, of the Olympic games,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Pl. 584", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(but δι' ἑνδεκάτου ἔτεος in the course of the eleventh year,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 1.62", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "). causal, through, by, of the Agent, δι' ἀγγέλων or -ου ἐπικηρυκεύεσθαι, ποιεῖσθαι, by the mouth of . .,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. 1.69", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "6.4", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.113", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ἑρμηνέως λέγειν X. An. 2.3.17", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.;"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὸ ῥηθὲν ὑπὸ Κυρίου δ. τοῦ προφήτου Ev.Matt. 1.22", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0031", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ἑκόντων ἀλλ' οὐ δ. βίας ποιεῖσθαι Pl. Phlb. 58b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; πεσόντ' ἀλλοτρίας διαὶ γυναικός by her doing,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Ag. 448", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(lyr.);"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐκ θεῶν γεγονὼς δ. βασιλέων πεφυκώς X. Cyr. 7.2.24", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; δι' ἑαυτοῦ ποιεῖν τι of oneself, not by another's agency, ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.1.4", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; but also, by oneself alone, unassisted,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D. 15.14", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "015", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "22.38", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "022", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". of the Instrument or Means, δ. χειρῶν by hand (prop. by holding between the hands),"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δι' ὁσίων χ. θιγών S. OC 470", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; also δ. χερῶν λαβεῖν, δ. χειρὸς ἔχειν in the hand,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. Ant. 916"